# TIDE's controls (DESIGN section 9): the first page is Mood, Density, Drift, Space; Drift fully down holds; the
# Bells page is Amount, Tone, Octave, Evolve; Ground has the pulse's place; everything is saved in TIDE's own slot
# and comes back after a restart. (par28 Mood, par29 Space, par4 Density, par6 Drift: amb.h P_*)
wait 500
expect view 0
expect par28 0
expect par29 0
expect par4 20
expect par6 15
shot tide.png
# KNOB 1: Mood, dark .. bright, -50 .. +50 around the piece's own
spin K1 20
expect par28 20
spin K1 40
expect par28 50
wait 200
shot mood_bright.png
spin K1 -120
expect par28 -50
wait 200
shot mood_dark.png
spin K1 50
expect par28 0
# Mood moves nothing on the Pad page: Bright there is still the piece's (par12)
expect par12 30
# KNOB 2: Density
spin K2 15
expect par4 35
spin K2 -15
expect par4 20
# KNOB 4: Space, near .. far; the Space page's own knobs stay where they are (par8 Echo, par10 Reverb, par11 Size)
spin K4 30
expect par29 30
expect par8 55
expect par10 85
expect par11 95
spin K4 -80
expect par29 -50
spin K4 50
expect par29 0
# KNOB 3: Drift. Fully down: HOLD (the chord, the field, the weather stay; the notes go on)
wait 20000
spin K3 -25
expect par6 0
wait 300
shot hold.png
wait 120000
expect playing 1
expect loopnotes >0
expect pad_level >0
shot hold_2min.png
spin K3 25
expect par6 25
# the Bells page (ARP): Amount, Tone, Octave, Evolve (par1, par14, par21, par5)
tap ARP
expect view 2
spin K1 10
expect par1 55
spin K1 -10
spin K2 -20
expect par14 50
spin K2 20
spin K3 1
expect par21 2
spin K3 -1
spin K4 5
expect par5 25
spin K4 -5
wait 200
shot bells.png
# the Ground page (SEQ): Level, Motion, Tempo; the fourth knob does nothing (par3, par15, par18)
tap SEQ
expect view 4
spin K1 10
expect par3 10
spin K1 -10
spin K2 5
expect par15 35
spin K2 -5
spin K3 3
expect par18 47
spin K3 -3
spin K4 9
wait 200
shot ground.png
# the other pages as AMB-1 has them
tap ENV
expect view 1
tap LFO
expect view 3
tap FX
expect view 5
tap GLO
expect view 6
tap HOME
expect view 0
# help: HOME held shows the page's card
press HOME
wait 1000
shot help_home.png
release HOME
wait 200
# save and restore: Mood and Space on Cryosleep, a different Mood on Hyperlane, each kept with its piece
spin K1 -15
spin K4 12
expect par28 -15
expect par29 12
turn PRESET 2
expect piece 2
expect par28 0
spin K1 25
expect par28 25
tap SAVE
expect store_writes 1
expect dirty 0
reboot
wait 500
expect piece 2
expect par28 25
expect par29 0
turn PRESET -2
expect piece 0
expect par28 -15
expect par29 12
# SAVE held: the piece back to its recipe, the two offsets to 0
press SAVE
wait 1700
release SAVE
expect par28 0
expect par29 0
# a record as AMB-1 writes it ("ENO1"), put where TIDE keeps its own: not read, the recipes instead
spin K1 9
storeamb
reboot
wait 500
expect piece 0
expect par28 0
